{"pageId":"/pages/docs/@slug","routeParams":{"*":"guides/comparison/commander"},"data":{"doc":{"slug":"guides/comparison/commander","title":"CLI Forge vs. commander","description":"Detailed comparison of CLI Forge and commander — type safety, option types, middleware, and more.","section":"Comparison","order":2,"filePath":"/home/runner/work/cli-forge/cli-forge/docs-site/docs/guides/comparison/commander.md","content":"\n# CLI Forge vs. commander\n\n[Commander](https://github.com/tj/commander.js) is the most widely used CLI library in the Node.js ecosystem, with zero runtime dependencies.\n\n## CLI Forge strengths\n\n- **Built-in type inference** — Commander's core [types `.opts()` as a generic object](https://github.com/tj/commander.js#typescript); type-safe options require the separate [`@commander-js/extra-typings`](https://github.com/commander-js/extra-typings) package. CLI Forge [infers types](/docs/guides/typescript) from every `.option()` call with no extra packages.\n- **Rich option types** — Native `number`, `array`, and `object` with automatic coercion ([example](/examples/object-arguments)). Commander treats values as strings by default; numbers require [custom processing functions](https://github.com/tj/commander.js#custom-option-processing).\n- **Middleware** — [Middleware pipeline](/docs/guides/middleware) transforms args between parsing and handler execution ([example](/examples/middleware-composition)). Commander has [`preAction`/`postAction` hooks](https://github.com/tj/commander.js#life-cycle-hooks) but no general-purpose middleware.\n- **Config file support** — [Config loading with `extends` inheritance](/docs/guides/configuration-files) ([example](/examples/configuration-files)). Commander has none.\n- **Documentation generation** — Built-in [`generate-docs`](/docs/cli/generate-documentation) command.\n- **Interactive shell** — [Opt-in REPL mode](/docs/guides/quick-start#the-interactive-shell) ([example](/examples/interactive-subshell)).\n- **Test harness** — [`TestHarness`](/docs/guides/testing) for parsing tests ([example](/examples/test-harness)).\n\n## Shared strengths\n\n- **Subcommands** — Both support [subcommands](https://github.com/tj/commander.js#commands) with nested command trees.\n- **Auto help generation** — Both generate help text automatically from option definitions.\n- **Validation** — Both support validation. CLI Forge has [choices, conflicts, implications](/docs/guides/validation) ([example](/examples/conflicts-and-implications)) and custom validators. Commander has [validation support](https://github.com/tj/commander.js#more-configuration) including `choices()` and `argParser()`.\n- **Env variable support** — Commander has [`.env()`](https://github.com/tj/commander.js#more-configuration). CLI Forge has [declarative env var mapping](/docs/guides/configuration-files#value-precedence) ([example](/examples/env-options)).\n\n## commander strengths\n\n- **Zero dependencies** — Entirely self-contained.\n- **Adoption** — Ubiquitous in the Node.js ecosystem with extensive documentation and examples.\n- **Standalone executables** — Can [spawn subcommands as separate processes](https://github.com/tj/commander.js#stand-alone-executable-subcommands) (e.g., `git`-style where `my-app install` runs a `my-app-install` binary).\n- **Lightweight API** — [String-based option definitions](https://github.com/tj/commander.js#options) (`'-p, --port <number>'`) are concise for simple CLIs where full type inference isn't needed.\n\n## Side-by-side example\n\nThe same CLI — a `greet` command with `hello` and `goodbye` subcommands — implemented in both libraries.\n\n<div class=\"code-tabs\" data-default=\"commander\">\n<div class=\"code-tab\" data-tab=\"commander\">\n\n<%= example('framework-comparison').file('commander.ts') %>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"code-tab\" data-tab=\"CLI Forge\">\n\n<%= example('framework-comparison').file('cli-forge.ts') %>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n[Back to comparison overview](/docs/guides/comparison) · [View all framework examples](/examples/framework-comparison)\n","renderedHtml":"<p><a href=\"https://github.com/tj/commander.js\">Commander</a> is the most widely used CLI library in the Node.js ecosystem, with zero runtime dependencies.</p>\n<h2 id=\"cli-forge-strengths\">CLI Forge strengths<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#cli-forge-strengths\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Built-in type inference</strong> — Commander's core <a href=\"https://github.com/tj/commander.js#typescript\">types <code>.opts()</code> as a generic object</a>; type-safe options require the separate <a href=\"https://github.com/commander-js/extra-typings\"><code>@commander-js/extra-typings</code></a> package. CLI Forge <a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/docs/guides/typescript\">infers types</a> from every <code>.option()</code> call with no extra packages.</li>\n<li><strong>Rich option types</strong> — Native <code>number</code>, <code>array</code>, and <code>object</code> with automatic coercion (<a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/examples/object-arguments\">example</a>). Commander treats values as strings by default; numbers require <a href=\"https://github.com/tj/commander.js#custom-option-processing\">custom processing functions</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Middleware</strong> — <a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/docs/guides/middleware\">Middleware pipeline</a> transforms args between parsing and handler execution (<a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/examples/middleware-composition\">example</a>). Commander has <a href=\"https://github.com/tj/commander.js#life-cycle-hooks\"><code>preAction</code>/<code>postAction</code> hooks</a> but no general-purpose middleware.</li>\n<li><strong>Config file support</strong> — <a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/docs/guides/configuration-files\">Config loading with <code>extends</code> inheritance</a> (<a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/examples/configuration-files\">example</a>). Commander has none.</li>\n<li><strong>Documentation generation</strong> — Built-in <a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/docs/cli/generate-documentation\"><code>generate-docs</code></a> command.</li>\n<li><strong>Interactive shell</strong> — <a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/docs/guides/quick-start#the-interactive-shell\">Opt-in REPL mode</a> (<a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/examples/interactive-subshell\">example</a>).</li>\n<li><strong>Test harness</strong> — <a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/docs/guides/testing\"><code>TestHarness</code></a> for parsing tests (<a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/examples/test-harness\">example</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"shared-strengths\">Shared strengths<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#shared-strengths\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Subcommands</strong> — Both support <a href=\"https://github.com/tj/commander.js#commands\">subcommands</a> with nested command trees.</li>\n<li><strong>Auto help generation</strong> — Both generate help text automatically from option definitions.</li>\n<li><strong>Validation</strong> — Both support validation. CLI Forge has <a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/docs/guides/validation\">choices, conflicts, implications</a> (<a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/examples/conflicts-and-implications\">example</a>) and custom validators. Commander has <a href=\"https://github.com/tj/commander.js#more-configuration\">validation support</a> including <code>choices()</code> and <code>argParser()</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Env variable support</strong> — Commander has <a href=\"https://github.com/tj/commander.js#more-configuration\"><code>.env()</code></a>. CLI Forge has <a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/docs/guides/configuration-files#value-precedence\">declarative env var mapping</a> (<a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/examples/env-options\">example</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"commander-strengths\">commander strengths<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#commander-strengths\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Zero dependencies</strong> — Entirely self-contained.</li>\n<li><strong>Adoption</strong> — Ubiquitous in the Node.js ecosystem with extensive documentation and examples.</li>\n<li><strong>Standalone executables</strong> — Can <a href=\"https://github.com/tj/commander.js#stand-alone-executable-subcommands\">spawn subcommands as separate processes</a> (e.g., <code>git</code>-style where <code>my-app install</code> runs a <code>my-app-install</code> binary).</li>\n<li><strong>Lightweight API</strong> — <a href=\"https://github.com/tj/commander.js#options\">String-based option definitions</a> (<code>'-p, --port &#x3C;number>'</code>) are concise for simple CLIs where full type inference isn't needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"side-by-side-example\">Side-by-side example<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"#side-by-side-example\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>The same CLI — a <code>greet</code> command with <code>hello</code> and <code>goodbye</code> subcommands — implemented in both libraries.</p>\n<div class=\"code-tabs\" data-default=\"commander\">\n<div class=\"code-tab\" data-tab=\"commander\">\n<pre class=\"shiki forge\" style=\"background-color:#0d0906f2;color:#c4a882\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FF8C38\">import </span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">{</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\"> </span><a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/api/cli-forge/command\" class=\"typedoc-link\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">Command</span></a><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#FF8C38\"> from </span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">commander</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FF8C38\">const</span><span style=\"color:#FF6A35\"> program</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\"> </span><a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/api/cli-forge/command\" class=\"typedoc-link\"><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">Command</span></a><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">greet</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">program</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">command</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">hello</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">description</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Say hello to someone</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">option</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">--name &#x3C;string></span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Name to greet</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">World</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">option</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">--uppercase</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Print greeting in uppercase</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#FF6A35\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">action</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">((</span><span style=\"color:#D4B898\">opts</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span><span style=\"color:#FF8C38\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FF8C38\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#FF6A35\"> msg</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> `</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Hello, </span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">${</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">opts</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">.</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">name</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">}</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">!</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">`</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">    console</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">log</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">opts</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">.</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">uppercase </span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">?</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\"> msg</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">toUpperCase</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">()</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\"> msg</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">program</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">command</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">goodbye</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">description</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Say goodbye to someone</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">option</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">--name &#x3C;string></span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Name to bid farewell</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">World</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">option</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">--formal</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Use formal farewell</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#FF6A35\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">action</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">((</span><span style=\"color:#D4B898\">opts</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span><span style=\"color:#FF8C38\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">    console</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">log</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">      opts</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">.</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">formal </span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">?</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> `</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Farewell, </span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">${</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">opts</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">.</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">name</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">}</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">.</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">`</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> `</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Bye, </span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">${</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">opts</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">.</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">name</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">}</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">!</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">program</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<div class=\"code-tab\" data-tab=\"CLI Forge\">\n<pre class=\"shiki forge\" style=\"background-color:#0d0906f2;color:#c4a882\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FF8C38\">import </span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">{</span><span style=\"color:#C4A882\"> </span><a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/api/cli-forge/cli-function\" class=\"typedoc-link\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">cli</span></a><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#FF8C38\"> from </span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">cli-forge</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><a href=\"/cli-forge/pr/47/api/cli-forge/cli-function\" class=\"typedoc-link\"><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">cli</span></a><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">greet</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">command</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">hello</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">:</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Say hello to someone</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">    builder</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">:</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D4B898\">args</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span><span style=\"color:#FF8C38\"> =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">      args</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">option</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">name</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">:</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">string</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">          description</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">:</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Name to greet</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">          default</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">:</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">World</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">option</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">uppercase</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">:</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">          description</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">:</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#FFB347\">Print greeting in uppercase</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">'</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C4A882\">          default</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">:</span><span style=\"color:#FF6A35\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A08060\">        }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E8C090\">    handler</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">:</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D4B898\">args</span><span style=\"color:#A08060\">)</span><span style=\"color:#FF8C38\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#A08060\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"colo